  "Posted 27 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "The list has no starting section. Starting cards follow the strategy: 'You start WYS stuff, and podracing, normally grabbing Squadron Assignments for the one effect' - Watch Your Step / This Place Can Be A Little Rough (posted 'Watch Your Step/This Place Can Be a Little Rough'), Podrace Prep and Squadron Assignments as the starting effect; all count toward the 60 (total 60).",
